  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a member, I want to reset my answer to the third-party notice, as LOT-071 promises, so that the choice is not final.\n\nLOT-071 says the choice \"can be reset in Settings\". No reset exists for `giphy_notice_accepted` (LOT-155) nor `rehost_notice_accepted` (LOT-102).\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] A Settings entry clears both, with a test.",
